('APX-S-820-1', 'APX-C-820', 1, null, null, null, 'A stop-motion wooden puppet Uzbek woman with round painted face, black braided hair and doppi hat, sitting still at a table with her hands folded, traditional ceramic bowls and teapot in front of her in a warm clay-walled room [cut] different camera shots of [puppet woman carefully pouring hot tea from a clay teapot into a small patterned bowl], [she lifts the bowl with both hands and slowly sips the warm tea], [she sets the bowl down and stands up from the table], [puppet woman walking through the room tidying up, folding fabrics and arranging ceramic pots on wooden shelves], [she wipes the table clean with a cloth], [puppet woman settling onto a floor cushion near the window], [she picks up an old worn book and opens it], [close-up of her painted eyes scanning the pages in warm natural window light], [A stop-motion animation puppet Uzbek woman, round painted face, black braided hair, wearing a multi-layered fur hat, vigorously kneading a large mound of dough on a flour-dusted wooden table, with bowls of minced meat, onions and greens placed nearby, along with a rolling pin and already-shaped samsas on a plate, background is a warm earthen-walled traditional kitchen] [CUT] filmed from different camera angles [the puppet woman picks up the rolling pin and rolls the dough flat on the flour-dusted wooden table], [she spoons the minced meat and chopped onions onto the center of each dough round], [her wooden hands carefully fold the dough into triangular samsa shapes], [she firmly presses each samsa against the scorching inner wall of the tandoor], [close-up shot of the samsas sizzling inside the tandoor gradually turning golden], [the puppet woman reaches in and removes a perfectly baked golden samsa from the tandoor wall], [she places the samsa on a plate, closes her eyes and leans in to deeply breathe in the rich aroma rising from the freshly baked samsa], and so on', null, null, 'A stop-motion wooden puppet Uzbek woman with round painted face, black braided hair and doppi hat, sitting still at a table with her hands folded, traditional ceramic bowls and teapot in front of her in a warm clay-walled room [cut]…', null, 'pouring; biting', 'tea', 'hero', 'kitchen', null),
