('APX-S-735-1', 'APX-C-735', 1, null, null, null, '**### Visual Style** 9:16 vertical composition, 4K ultra-clear realistic quality. Low-key lighting style, high contrast. The cool-toned environmental background forms a sharp contrast with the subject''s all-black clothing, emphasizing the figure''s contours and skin luster, possessing the typical sharp texture of social media short videos. **### Scene Narrative** Indoor home environment (suspected modern style kitchen or living room), blurred white cabinets visible in the background.', null, null, 'The cool-toned environmental background forms a sharp contrast with the subject''s all-black clothing, emphasizing the figure''s contours and skin luster, possessing the typical sharp texture of social media short videos.', null, null, null, null, 'kitchen', null),
('APX-S-735-2', 'APX-C-735', 2, null, null, null, 'The core subject is a young, long-haired woman in a black tight long-sleeved crop top and hot pants [@Image 1], performing a highly rhythmic modern dance in a dim space following the music, the overall atmosphere showcasing confidence and allure. **### Cinematography** Camera: Fixed position (Lock-off), maintaining image stability, relying on the movement of the figure within the frame to create dynamics.', null, null, '### Cinematography** Camera: Fixed position (Lock-off), maintaining image stability, relying on the movement of the figure within the frame to create dynamics.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-735-3', 'APX-C-735', 3, null, null, null, 'Mood: Confident, alluring, dynamic, cool and fierce. **### Action List** - Raise both hands to stroke the back of the head, then open them to the sides, coordinating with large left and right swings of the hips. - The body presents a smooth S-shaped wave rhythm (Body Roll), demonstrating core control. - The head slightly shakes with the rhythm, and the long hair naturally swings with the movement. - The eyes constantly look directly at the camera, maintaining continuous eye contact, and featuring distinct body freezes (Pop) at the beat accents. **### Dialogue/Text** - No dialogue. - On-screen text: "None" **### Background Sound** - Music: High BPM EDM/Deep House dance music, featuring deep, powerful bass lines and clear drum beats. - Sound Effects: No special environmental sound effects, purely music-driven. - Mixing: The music soundstage is forward, low frequencies are prominent, emphasizing strict synchronization between visual action and auditory rhythm.', null, null, 'The eyes constantly look directly at the camera, maintaining continuous eye contact, and featuring distinct body freezes (Pop) at the beat accents.', null, null, null, null, null, 'intense'),
