('APX-S-708-1', 'APX-C-708', 1, null, null, null, 'Third-person skateboard rear low-angle view, ultra-wide-angle strong perspective, the camera slowly tilts synchronously with the road''s left curve, slight camera shake simulates the feeling of following the ride, low speed entering the curve → rapid acceleration. 【@Image 1】leans left to carve the curve, the hem of the top and hair violently stream backward in the wind; the road''s high-brightness white/yellow markings begin to show motion blur, extremely green roadside vegetation and bright red flowers appear as horizontal dynamic blur; distant sea reflections refract light along the curve, high-speed shutter freezes the wheels showing initial afterimages, slight edge blurring, retaining high-saturation pure color contrast between the road surface and flowers/grass, film grain begins to appear.', null, null, 'Third-person skateboard rear, ultra-wide-angle strong perspective, the camera slowly tilts synchronously with the road''s left curve, slight camera shake simulates the feeling of following the ride, low speed entering the curve → rapid…', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-708-2', 'APX-C-708', 2, null, null, null, 'The camera tilts violently left and right following continuous S-curves, closely following the subject in a rapid dive, ultra-wide-angle perspective maximized, small vertical camera bumps enhance the realistic feeling of sliding. Camera locks onto the 【@Image 1】subject throughout, 【@Image 1】continuously shifts weight left and right, body shakes significantly downhill, clothing and hair are completely pulled into streamlined shapes by the strong wind; high-speed rotating wheels pull out long afterimages, road markings turn into dense speed lines, roadside flowers and trees are compressed into colorful blurry color bands; Strong light reflections on the sea surface distort and dissipate with speed, global strong dynamic blur + edge blurring, high-noise film texture maximized, layering in dark areas highlighted, extreme impact from pure color high contrast (green mountains / red flowers / bright markings / blue sea).', null, null, 'The camera tilts violently left and right following continuous S-curves, closely following the subject in a rapid dive, ultra-wide-angle perspective maximized, small vertical camera bumps enhance the feeling of sliding.', null, 'sliding', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-708-3', 'APX-C-708', 3, null, null, null, 'As the road exits the curve, the camera slowly straightens, the perspective slightly lifts, the follow speed slightly slows but still maintains a high-speed trajectory, ending the violent tilting. 【@Image 1】straightens the body, stabilizes the posture, clothing and hair still retain residual movement; wheel afterimages and speed lines gradually fade but retain dynamic lingering effect, road markings become clear again but edges still retain slight blur; flower and grass blurry color bands converge, sea reflections return to soft light, dynamic blur weakens, retaining the texture of high-speed photography, ending with the back view of 【@Image 1】diving + high-saturation scenery of mountains and sea, maximizing layering and atmosphere.', null, null, 'As the road exits the curve, the camera slowly straightens, the perspective slightly lifts, the follow speed slightly slows but still maintains a high-speed trajectory, ending the violent tilting.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
